      "content": "That's a good start, pretty high-level. Could you go into a bit more detail on the specific \"cons\" or criticisms being raised? Especially regarding the impact on manufacturing and the potential for \"carbon leakage\"? I need to make sure the summary isn't just glossing over the harder parts of the debate.",
